Route44_Text_PsychicPhilIntro::
	.string "I’m gonna win, for sure!$"

Route44_Text_PsychicPhilDefeat::
	.string "Arrgh... That’s a shocking loss…$"

Route44_Text_PsychicPhil::
	.string "It’s important to have conviction\n"
	.string "on your side.$"

Route44_Text_PokemaniacZachIntro::
	.string "I’ll do anything to get my hands on\n"
	.string "rare POKéMON!$"

Route44_Text_PokemaniacZachDefeat::
	.string "Oooh, your POKéMON are so appealing.$"

Route44_Text_PokemaniacZach::
	.string "If a POKéMON has different colors\n"
	.string "from usual, it’s more valuable.\p"
	.string "What?\n"
	.string "You mean that’s not true?$"

Route44_Text_Fisherman244Intro::
	.string "Aack! You made me lose a POLIWAG!\p"
	.string "What are you going to do about it?$"

Route44_Text_Fisherman244Defeat::
	.string "Just forget about it.$"

Route44_Text_Fisherman244::
	.string "That POLIWAG that got away...\n"
	.string "It was huge.\p"
	.string "I swear it must’ve been 16 feet long!$"

Route44_Text_FishermanEdgarIntro::
	.string "I fish until I can’t anymore.\p"
	.string "I also battle until I drop.\p"
	.string "That’s my relationship with\n"
	.string "my POKéMON.$"

Route44_Text_FishermanEdgarDefeat::
	.string "Hmmmm...\n"
	.string "This isn’t right.$"

Route44_Text_FishermanEdgar::
	.string "That’s 100 wins to 101 loses.\n"
	.string "I won’t battle again for a while.$"

Route44_Text_CooltrainerCybilIntro::
	.string "You look strong.\p"
	.string "Good trainers seek tough opponents\n"
	.string "instinctively.$"

Route44_Text_CooltrainerCybilDefeat::
	.string "Nope! This won’t do at all.$"

Route44_Text_CooltrainerCybil::
	.string "We all get better by experiencing\n"
	.string "many battles.\p"
	.string "I battled a lot to become what I am\n"
	.string "today--an elite.$"

Route44_Text_CooltrainerAllenIntro::
	.string "I can tell you’re a good trainer by\n"
	.string "looking at you.\p"
	.string "I’m good at POKéMON, and I can see\n"
	.string "that you are too.$"

Route44_Text_CooltrainerAllenDefeat::
	.string "Tch! It’s a total loss on my part.$"

Route44_Text_CooltrainerAllen::
	.string "Wow. You have a lot of BADGES.\n"
	.string "No wonder you’re so tough.\p"
	.string "I wonder if ECRUTEAK GYM’s MORTY\n"
	.string "is still in training?\l"
	.string "He really hammered me.$"

Route44_Text_BirdKeeper99Intro::
	.string "Do you know about the legendary bird\n"
	.string "POKéMON?$"

Route44_Text_BirdKeeper99Defeat::
	.string "Whew! You’re hot stuff.$"

Route44_Text_BirdKeeper99::
	.string "ARTICUNO, ZAPDOS and MOLTRES are\n"
	.string "the three legendary bird POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I heard there are other legendary\n"
	.string "birds, though.$"

Route44_Text_PkmnTrainerCarlos3_1::
	.string "Hahaha!\p"
	.string "Finally I’m ahead of you again!\p"
	.string "While you were playing to be hero,\n"
	.string "I defeated MAHOGANY’s GYM!\p"
	.string "Now, I’ll beat the next GYM to win my\n"
	.string "last BADGE!\p"
	.string "I don’t need you around, so this is\n"
	.string "the end of the road for you!$"

Route44_Text_PkmnTrainerCarlos3Defeat::
	.string "N... No...\n"
	.string "Not again...$"

Route44_Text_PkmnTrainerCarlos3Victory::
	.string "See ya, loser!$"

Route44_Text_PkmnTrainerCarlos3_2::
	.string "ARRGH!!!\p"
	.string "Why do you keep beating me?!!!\p"
	.string "I HATE you!\n"
	.string "I DESPISE you!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Now I need to go to that POKéMON\n"
	.string "CENTER to heal my POKéMON...\p"
	.string "But...\p"
	.string "I still know I’ll reach the POKéMON\n"
	.string "LEAGUE before you!\p"
	.string "It’s only a matter of time...$"

Route44_Text_Sign1::
	.string "ROUTE 44\n"
	.string "MAHOGANY TOWN - BLACKTHORN CITY$"

Route44_Text_Sign2::
	.string "ROUTE 44\n"
	.string "ICE PATH AHEAD$"

Route44_Text_Sign3::
	.string "It’s a fruit-bearing tree.\p"
	.string "Hey! It’s RAWST BERRY!$"
